Qwen Linux ANE task-layout correction
=====================================

Observed artifact geometry
--------------------------

The converted 13-layer graph contains variable source gaps between linked tasks:

- 0x200: 488
- 0x300: 898
- 0x400: 10
- 0x500: 7

The converted 11-layer graph also contains variable source gaps:

- 0x200: 423
- 0x300: 735
- 0x400: 11
- 0x500: 6

The former full-graph path copied each descriptor into a fixed 0x300-byte slot.
That rewrite did not preserve bytes between task starts when a source gap was
0x400 or 0x500 bytes.

Correction
----------

A complete graph now copies the compiled task stream without changing its
layout or NextPointer values. Partial diagnostic ranges still use dense packing
and pointer remapping.

